WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.341
"Uh-oh," Peter said.

2
00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:08.712
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle is gone.

3
00:00:08.713 --> 00:00:12.373
What should we do?"

4
00:00:12.374 --> 00:00:15.310
"Let's play!" Benjamin said.

5
00:00:15.311 --> 00:00:17.492
"We can get my kite."

6
00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:22.600
Peter shook his head. "I can't play yet.

7
00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:29.675
Those clothes are still dirty."

8
00:00:29.676 --> 00:00:33.311
"We can wash your clothes!" Benjamin said.

9
00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:35.627
"It's easy."

10
00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:38.905
Peter smiled. "Good idea!

11
00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:47.477
Then we can fly your kite."

12
00:00:47.478 --> 00:00:53.254
The bunnies filled some buckets with water.

13
00:00:53.255 --> 00:00:56.359
They dumped in lots of soap.

14
00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:01.036
Bubbles flew into the air.

15
00:01:01.037 --> 00:01:05.066
"Ahh! I can't see!" Peter cried.

16
00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:09.432
"Be careful!" Benjamin called.

17
00:01:09.433 --> 00:01:11.794
But it was too late.

18
00:01:11.795 --> 00:01:15.911
Peter bumped into some buckets.

19
00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:19.624
Whoosh!

20
00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:27.452
Water and soap spilled everywhere.

21
00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:30.498
"Oh no!" Peter cried.

22
00:01:30.499 --> 00:01:34.177
"Now all the clothes are wet and soapy!"

23
00:01:34.178 --> 00:01:44.219
"I will find a mop," Benjamin said.

24
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:47.843
"Oops!" Benjamin slipped in the water.

25
00:01:47.844 --> 00:01:51.527
He banged into the table. Crash!

26
00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:54.872
Buckets and clothes flew everywhere.

27
00:01:54.873 --> 00:02:01.153
More soap spilled on the floor.

28
00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.461
Peter gulped.

29
00:02:03.462 --> 00:02:07.515
"We made a big mess," he said.

30
00:02:07.516 --> 00:02:09.296
Knock! Knock!

31
00:02:09.298 --> 00:02:13.174
Someone was at the door!

